<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Atwood cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Atwood cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw analyst Iain Smith said he downgraded Atwood Oceanics Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the deep-water drilling concern were off 1-5/8 to 66.</p>
<p>--Smith said Atwood's long-term outlook remains good, but the stock offers the least value in the sector over the short term and looks less likely to be an acquisition target.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
